  IsDragging: 1
  IsSelected: 0
  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Adrianne
    Text: "The high priest has arrived to bless the body as well as prepare the royal
      funeral rites. He is meant to also try to act as a witness to the investigation
      and calm political tensions since the neighboring Kingdoms all respect the
      church. He got here as soon as he could. He\u2019s in the throne room right
      now. "
